{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"15":"Jihad (Kitab Al-Jihad)"},"section_detail":{"15":{"hadithnumber_first":2477,"hadithnumber_last":2787,"arabicnumber_first":2477,"arabicnumber_last":2787,"name_native":"Jihad (Kitab Al-Jihad)"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":2564,"arabicnumber":2564,"text":"Jabir reported the Prophet (ﷺ) as saying when an ass which had been branded on its face passed him. Did it not reach you that I cursed him who branded the animals on their faces or struck them on their faces. So he prohibited it","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Muslim (2117)"}],"reference":{"book":15,"hadith":88}}]}